  "metaTitle": "Rent Receipt Format: Free Word, Excel & PDF Template",
  "metaDescription": "Free rent receipt format in Word, Excel and PDF. Two receipts per page, a yearly rent log with totals, landlord PAN reminder and signature space.",
  "short": "Monthly house rent receipt with landlord, tenant and payment details, plus an Excel yearly rent log.",
